&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:DebtorsNotesRegardingOverdraftContractsAndOrLoanCommitmentsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfContractLiabilitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="line-height:12pt;"&gt;※５  その他のうち、契約負債の金額は、以下のとおりであります。&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:center;margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_center" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:415pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:185pt;min-width:185pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:115pt;min-width:115pt;"/&gt;
